            "actions": [
              {
                "id": "08-galeria-de-slides-7",
                "kind": "SLIDE",
                "format": "html",
                "markdown": "",
                "html": "<style>\n  body {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 80px;\n    padding: 0 140px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    background: #f8fafc;\n    color: #0f172a;\n  }\n  h2 {\n    font-size: 80px;\n    margin: 0 0 30px;\n  }\n  p {\n    font-size: 44px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    margin: 0;\n    color: #334155;\n  }\n  svg {\n    width: 100%;\n  }\n  .gira {\n    transform-origin: 300px 300px;\n    animation: girar 12s linear infinite;\n  }\n  @keyframes girar {\n    to {\n      transform: rotate(360deg);\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n<div>\n  <h2>Texto e imagem</h2>\n  <p>Explique a ideia à esquerda e mostre um desenho, foto ou diagrama à direita.</p>\n</div>\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 600\">\n  <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"300\" r=\"260\" fill=\"#e0e7ff\" />\n  <g class=\"gira\">\n    <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"80\" r=\"50\" fill=\"#6366f1\" />\n    <circle cx=\"510\" cy=\"300\" r=\"50\" fill=\"#ec4899\" />\n    <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"520\" r=\"50\" fill=\"#14b8a6\" />\n    <circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"300\" r=\"50\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" />\n  </g>\n  <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"300\" r=\"90\" fill=\"#4338ca\" />\n</svg>",
                "transition": "slide-up"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "08-galeria-de-slides-8",
          "parentId": "08-galeria-de-slides-1",
          "type": "STEP",
          "title": "Número em destaque",
          "data": {
            "actions": [
              {
                "id": "08-galeria-de-slides-9",
                "kind": "SLIDE",
                "format": "html",
                "markdown": "",
                "html": "<style>\n  body {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle, #065f46, #022c22);\n  }\n  .numero {\n    font-size: 320px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    line-height: 1;\n    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  }\n  p {\n    font-size: 56px;\n    margin: 20px 0 0;\n    opacity: 0.85;\n  }\n</style>\n<div class=\"numero\" id=\"numero\">0</div>\n<p>alunos já fizeram este curso</p>\n<script>\n  const alvo = 1250\n  const el = document.getElementById('numero')\n  const inicio = performance.now()\n  function passo(agora) {\n    const t = Math.min(1, (agora - inicio) / 2000)\n    el.textContent = Math.round(alvo * (1 - Math.pow(1 - t, 3))).toLocaleString('pt-BR')\n    if (t < 1) requestAnimationFrame(passo)\n  }\n  requestAnimationFrame(passo)\n</script>",
                "transition": "zoom"
              }
            ],
            "caption": "O número conta até o valor com um script."
          }
        },
