                "html": "<style>\n  body {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 0 120px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    background: #1e1b4b;\n  }\n  h2 {\n    font-size: 80px;\n    margin: 0 0 100px;\n  }\n  .linha {\n    position: relative;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n  }\n  .linha::before {\n    content: '';\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    top: 30px;\n    height: 8px;\n    background: #6366f1;\n    transform-origin: left;\n    animation: crescer 1.5s ease both;\n  }\n  .marco {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 300px;\n    text-align: center;\n    opacity: 0;\n    animation: aparecer 500ms ease forwards;\n  }\n  .marco::before {\n    content: '';\n    display: block;\n    width: 68px;\n    height: 68px;\n    margin: 0 auto 30px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #f472b6;\n  }\n  .marco b {\n    display: block;\n    font-size: 56px;\n  }\n  .marco span {\n    font-size: 36px;\n    opacity: 0.8;\n  }\n  .marco:nth-child(1) {\n    animation-delay: 0.3s;\n  }\n  .marco:nth-child(2) {\n    animation-delay: 0.8s;\n  }\n  .marco:nth-child(3) {\n    animation-delay: 1.3s;\n  }\n  .marco:nth-child(4) {\n    animation-delay: 1.8s;\n  }\n  @keyframes crescer {\n    from {\n      transform: scaleX(0);\n    }\n  }\n  @keyframes aparecer {\n    to {\n      opacity: 1;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n<h2>Linha do tempo (tela cheia)</h2>\n<div class=\"linha\">\n  <div class=\"marco\"><b>1991</b><span>Python</span></div>\n  <div class=\"marco\"><b>1995</b><span>JavaScript e PHP</span></div>\n  <div class=\"marco\"><b>2005</b><span>Git</span></div>\n  <div class=\"marco\"><b>Hoje</b><span>Sua aula</span></div>\n</div>",
